----
:'''Yanqing:''' Captain, could you spare a moment?
:'''Cloud Knights Captain:''' Yanqing? Why are you all the way out here on the front lines? Shouldn't you be back at the Seat of Divine Foresight?
:'''Yanqing:''' The general already has a lot on his plate. As his retainer, it's my duty to share the burden...
:'''Yanqing:''' Nothing new to report, I assume?
:'''Cloud Knights Captain:''' Correct. After this "Blade" escaped from The Shackling Prison, he disappeared into thin air. I wonder if he's even still on the ship?
:'''Yanqing:''' Or perhaps he had no intention of escaping in the first place.
:'''Cloud Knights Captain:''' *sigh* What foul demons found their way across the stars to wreak havoc on the Luofu?
:'''Yanqing:''' That's why I'm here &mdash; to help the general eliminate those demons.
:'''Cloud Knights Captain:''' Is that so? I didn't receive any orders from the general.
:'''Yanqing:''' Ahem... This is a covert operation.
:'''Cloud Knights Captain:''' ...Then shall we dispatch a few knights for this "operation" of yours?
:'''Yanqing:''' I appreciate the gesture... but the fewer people who know about a covert operation, the better.
:'''Yanqing:''' Making a big show of it will only scare the snake deeper into the grass... A good hunter must operate alone.
----
:'''Yanqing:''' "Dispatch a few knights..." Hmph, how incapable does he think I am?
:'''Yanqing:''' I might be young now, but just you wait...

;(Talk to Jingliu)
:'''Jingliu:''' Where exactly are we headed, young man?
:'''Yanqing:''' To the docks. Don't worry, you'll be safe.
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} (Where did she come from...?)
::'''Yanqing:''' So are you from one of the other Xianzhou ships? The Yaoqing? The Fanghu?
::'''Jingliu:''' ...I'm from the Cangcheng.
::'''Yanqing:''' The Cangcheng? There's a ship called the Cangcheng? Why haven't I heard of it...?
:;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} (How long has she been away...?)
::'''Yanqing:''' Miss Jingliu, how long has it been since you last set foot on the Luofu?
::'''Jingliu:''' Are you always this talkative?
::'''Yanqing:''' Uh... Just making conversation &mdash; I wanted you to know I was still here.
:;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} (Let's get going...)
::'''Yanqing:''' Let's get going, miss. Careful &mdash; take your time.
::----
