----
:'''Jingliu:''' Where do we go from here?
----
:'''Yanqing:''' Shh, quiet... We've got trouble to deal with first.
:'''Yanqing:''' Wait here a moment, miss &mdash; I'll be right back.
----
----
:'''Yanqing:''' Where did these guys come from? Huh, the general was right &mdash; there's a threat lurking on the Xianzhou itself.
:'''Jingliu:''' You are quite the swordmaster, young man.
:'''Yanqing:''' You... you saw that?
:'''Jingliu:''' I heard it. A sword whistles through the air and rings out upon contacting the enemy ... Whilst invisible to the eye, such signals reveal the quality of one's swordplay.
:'''Jingliu:''' As a musician listens to the notes of a song, so a poet listens to its rhyme... and in the flow of combat, a skilled swordmaster delivers both with their blade. I'll wager the Cloud Knights capable of wielding six flying swords at a time number few indeed.
:'''Yanqing:''' Uh, haha, thanks miss.
:'''Jingliu:''' However, your zealousness inhibits your ability to hide your line of attack....
:'''Yanqing:''' Huh...?
:'''Jingliu:''' ...which causes your sword's song to become somewhat mumbled at the end.
:'''Yanqing:''' ...I guess the connection between music and swordplay is real after all. The general told me something similar &mdash; he said my swordplay was too proud and angular. He said it lacked the maturity required to win the title of Sword Champion...
:'''Jingliu:''' Sword Champion? If I recall correctly, that title is bestowed on one who reaches the pinnacle of swordsmanship in the Cloud Knights. But that was a long time ago...
:'''Yanqing:''' Right! Ever since the Sedition of Imbibitor Lunae, the title of Sword Champion has gone unclaimed. But once everything settles down and the Combat Arts Ceremony returns, it's a title I'm determined to win!
:'''Jingliu:''' The Cloud Knights have many martial arts traditions. Who was it that instructed you in swordplay, young man?
:'''Yanqing:''' I see you're no stranger to the art &mdash; I won't keep you in suspense. My master is none other than General Jing Yuan of the Luofu.
:'''Jingliu:''' General...
:'''Yanqing:''' I know you haven't visited for a long time, but surely you've heard of General Jing Yuan? He says he has no affinity with the sword &mdash; that his skills are getting rusty... Well, if that's true, I never noticed from his training.
----
